gui/ holds the session GUI textures of 0 A.D.
(binaries/data/mods/public/art/textures/ui/: the panel, border, shader and
bar textures, resource, rank, group and repair icons, phase emblems, the
minimap circle and civ backgrounds, the portrait background, and the civ
emblems, these turned grey), made by Wildfire Games,
http://www.wildfiregames.com/

They are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0,
http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/, and so are the converted
copies in gui/.

It also holds the fonts the engine draws its sans text with
(binaries/data/mods/mod/fonts/), as they are:
- LinBiolinum_Rah.ttf and LinBiolinum_RBah.ttf, Linux Biolinum, under the
  licence in LibBiolinum-LICENSE.txt there (GNU General Public License
  version 3 or later with the font exception);
- FreeSans.ttf and FreeSansBold.ttf, GNU FreeFont, under the GNU General
  Public License version 3 or later with the font exception, as in
  FreeFont-LICENSE.txt there.

Rebuild them with: cargo run -p specula-tools --release --bin session-gui
